flowchart LR
    Browser[Client browser\nDesktop or mobile responsive web UI]
    Laravel[Laravel 12 application\nPHP 8.2+ / Blade / routes / controllers / services / Eloquent]
    DB[(Configured relational database\nPostgreSQL in current development config; MySQL/MariaDB supported by backup path)]
    Queue[(Database queue tables)]
    Scheduler[Laravel scheduler / cron\nartisan scheduled commands]
    Worker[Queue worker\nqueued jobs and analytics]
    ML[FastAPI ML service\npython_scripts/main.py\nuvicorn :8010]
    Models[(Model files and metadata\nstorage/models; Docker ml-models volume)]
    OpenMeteo[Open-Meteo API]
    PAGASA[PAGASA web advisories\nand historical Ambulong data]
    GeoRisk[GeoRisk Philippines\nbarangay boundaries]
    Tiles[OpenStreetMap / Esri\nmap tiles]
    GeoJSON[Local GeoJSON\npublic/geojson]
    Groq[Groq API\nClimora fallback]
    Mail[Configured mail server\npassword reset only]
    Storage[Local storage\nreports, backups, uploads]

    Browser -->|HTTP/HTTPS web routes and JSON endpoints| Laravel
    Browser -->|Leaflet map tile requests| Tiles
    Browser -->|reads local boundary assets| GeoJSON
    Laravel -->|Eloquent queries / transactions| DB
    Laravel -->|dispatch jobs| Queue
    Worker -->|claims and records jobs| Queue
    Scheduler -->|runs artisan commands| Worker
    Scheduler -->|records scheduled runs| DB
    Worker -->|queued prediction / analytics HTTP calls| ML
    Laravel -->|prediction / health HTTP calls| ML
    ML -->|loads and writes model artifacts| Models
    Laravel -->|weather HTTP requests| OpenMeteo
    Laravel -->|advisory fetch / parsing| PAGASA
    Laravel -->|boundary acquisition / sync| GeoRisk
    Laravel -->|AI fallback HTTP request| Groq
    Laravel -->|password-reset mail| Mail
    Laravel -->|reports, backups, attachments| Storage
